OL,3,GNEWSABoy's cancer symptoms missed three
OL,4,Atimes, says coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has raised concerns after a
OL,7,Fthree-year-old boy died "earlier than
OL,8,Fhe would otherwise have done" had
OL,9,Fmultiple medical practitioners spotted
OL,10,Fhe was unwell.
OL,12,FJaxon Olivera died in March 2025 as a
OL,13,Fresult of leukaemia, which had been
OL,14,Fdiagnosed three days before at St
OL,15,FPeter's Hospital in Chertsey, Surrey.
OL,17,FCoroner Dr Karen Henderson wrote that a
OL,18,Fnurse, a GP and an A&E doctor failed to
OL,19,Fnotice liver problems that could have
OL,20,Fled to an earlier diagnosis.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
